{
  "id": "commerce-chat-real-regression-v1",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "mcd-real-sealed-v1",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "人在上海人民广场，想看看麦当劳。找离这里近、还开着的店，把最近那家的菜单给我瞧瞧，暂时不用买。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "就从这份菜单里挑一款现在卖的鸡肉汉堡套餐，一份，按店里的原配搭配。给我做个订单报价就行，别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.prepare_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "needs_selection",
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "拿走吃，不在店里吃。把刚才那份的最终金额列一下。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "proposed"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.revise_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "算了，这份先不买，把刚刚那个订单草稿撤掉吧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.cancel_checkout"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}